  <para style="h">Abaheburayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete ryandikiwe Abaheburayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaheburayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete ryandikiwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abaheburayo</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Imana yavuze iciye mu Mwana wayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Kera Imana yavuganye na ba sogokuruza kenshi kandi mu buryo bwinshi iciye ku bavugishwa na yo. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Ariko muri iyi misi y’iherezo, yavuganye natwe iciye ku Mwana wayo. Uwo ni we Imana yagize samuragwa w’ibintu vyose, kandi ivyaremwe vyose yabiremye iciye muri we. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Uwo Mwana yerekana ugukayangana kw’ubwiza bw’Imana kandi ni we shusho nyayo iboneka y’ubumana bwayo. Vyongeye ni we ashigikije vyose ijambo ryiwe ry’inkomezi. Ahejeje gushiraho uburyo bwo kwoza ivyaha vyacu, yaciye yicara mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’Imana y’icubahiro mw’ijuru. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Ibi vyerekana ko Umwana aruta cane abamarayika, nk’uko izina Imana yamuhaye riruta amazina yabo.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwana aruta abamarayika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Ni nde mu bamarayika Imana yigeze ivugako iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Uri Umwana wanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">uwu musi ndakuvyaye”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Zaburi 2:7</ref></char></char></note>?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Canke iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nzomubera Se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">na we azombera Umwana”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Samweli 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Ngoma 17:13</ref></char></char></note>?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kandi igihe Imana yazana Umwana wayo w’imfura mw’isi, yavuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Abamarayika bose b’Imana nibamusenge.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Gusubiramwo 32:43</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ku bijanye n’abamarayika, yavuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Abamarayika bayo ibahindura imiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">abakozi bayo ikabagira imbeya z’umuriro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Zaburi 104:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ariko ku vyerekeye Umwana, ivuga iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Ukuganza kwawe, ewe Mana, kuzokwamaho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ubugororotsi ni ryo cumu ry’inganji y’Ubwami bwawe.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Wakunze ubugororotsi, wanka ikibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ni co gituma Imana, ari yo Mana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">yagutoranije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">ikakurobanuza amavuta y’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ikakurutisha bagenzawe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 45:6">Zaburi 45:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Yongera iravuga iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Ni wewe, Uhoraho, washizeho amatanguriro y’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">kandi amaboko yawe ni yo yaremye amajuru.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Ivyo bizoshira, ariko wewe wamaho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Vyose bizosaza nk’impuzu.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Uzobizinga nk’uwuzinga impuzu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">bizohindurwa nk’uko bahindura impuzu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ariko wewe uhora uko wamye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">kandi imyaka yawe ntigira iherezo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Zaburi 102:25-27</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Ni nde mu bamarayika Imana yigeze ivugako iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Icara i buryo bwanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">kugeza abansi bawe bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">ndabashize musi y’ibirenge vyawe”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zaburi 110:1</ref></char></char></note>?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Mbega abamarayika bose si impwemu zikorera Imana? Ntiyazitumye gukorera abazoragwa agakiza?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tube maso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ni co gituma dutegerezwa kwitwararika cane ukuri twumvise, kugira ngo ntituzimire tukakuvamwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Nimba ubutumwa Imana yarungikanye abamarayika bwabonetse ari ukuri, kandi ukugarariza kwose n’ukutumvira kwose bikaronka igihano bikwiranye, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />none twebwe tuzokira gute nitwanjanjwa ku gakiza gakomeye nk’ako? Umwami Yesu ubwiwe ni we yabanje kuvuga ivy’ako gakiza, hanyuma abamwumvise baratwemeza ko ari ukuri. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Imana na yo yashigikiye intahe yabo ibicishije mu bimenyetso n’ibitangaza bitandukanye yakoze, hamwe n’ingabire za Mpwemu Yera yatanze uko ibishatse.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwazanye agakiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Imana ntiyahaye abamarayika kuganza iyi si izoza turiko turavuga. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Ahubwo, mu Vyanditswe hari uwashinze intahe ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Mbega umuntu ni iki kugira ngo umwibuke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">umwana w’umuntu kugira ngo umwiteho?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Habuze gato ngo umunganye n’abamarayika;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">kandi wamwambitse ubwiza n’icubahiro,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />kandi ibintu vyose wabishize musi y’ububasha bwiwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Zaburi 8:4-6</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Nimba Imana yashize vyose musi y’ububasha bw’umuntu, bisigura ko ata kintu na kimwe casigaye kitari musi y’ububasha bwiwe. Ariko gushika ubu ntitubona ko vyose biri musi y’ububasha bwiwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ico tubona ni iki: Yesu yagizwe uwuri musi y’abamarayika igihe gito, none ubu yambaye ubwiza n’icubahiro kuko yadupfiriye twese. Ni ku bw’ubuntu bw’Imana Yesu yapfiriye abantu bose.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Vyari bikwiye ko Imana, yo yaremye vyose kandi bikaremerwa kuba ivyayo, itunganya rwose Yesu biciye mu mubabaro, kugira ngo ishikane abana bayo benshi mu bwiza bwayo, kuko Yesu ari we yatanguje inzira y’agakiza. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Yesu ni we yeza abantu ivyaha vyabo. Uweza hamwe n’abezwa bose bafise Se umwe. Ni co gituma Yesu bitamutera isoni kubita abavukanyi biwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Kuko yabwiye Imana ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Nzokwamamaza izina ryawe mu bavukanyi banje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Nzoguhimbaza ikoraniro rikoranye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Zaburi 22:22</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Yaravuze kandi ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Nzokwizigira Imana.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">Yesaya 8:17</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Yongerako ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Jewe n’abana Imana yampaye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:18">Yesaya 8:18</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Abo bana hari ikintu basangiye: bose ni abantu. Yesu na we ubwiwe yahindutse umuntu nka bo kugira ngo, biciye mu rupfu rwiwe, amare inkomezi uwari afise ububasha bw’urupfu, ari we Satani. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Ubu ni bwo buryo bwonyene yari gushobora kubohora abantu bari babayeho ubuzima bwabo bwose nk’abagurano kubera gutinya urupfu. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Ikindi tuzi ni uko Umwana w’Imana ataje gufasha abamarayika; ahubwo yaje gufasha uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ni co gituma vyari bikwiye ko ahinduka agasa natwe abavukanyi biwe muri vyose; kugira ngo atubere Umuherezi Mukuru w’umunyembabazi kandi w’umwizigirwa imbere y’Imana, kugira ngo atange ikimazi gikura ivyaha vy’abantu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Ni co gituma ashobora kudufasha iyo tugeragezwa, kuko na we yageragejwe n’imibabaro yaciyemwo.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aruta Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Nuko rero bene Data, mwebwe mwahamagawe n’Imana, mwiyumvire cane kuri uwu Yesu, uwo twemera nk’intumwa n’Umuherezi Mukuru wacu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Yabaye umwizigirwa imbere y’Imana yo yamujeje iki gikorwa, nk’uko Mose yakoze nk’umwizigirwa igihe Imana yamuzeza inzu yayo yose. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Ariko Yesu akwiye icubahiro kiruta ica Mose, nk’uko uwubatse inzu akwiye icubahiro kiruta ic’inzu yubatse. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Inzu yose irafise uwayubatse, ariko Imana ni yo yubatse vyose. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />“Mose yabaye umwizigirwa mu nzu y’Imana nk’umukozi,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Guharura 12:7</ref></char></char></note> kugira ngo ashingire intahe ivyo Imana yari igiye kuvuga muri kazoza. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ariko Kristo ni umwizigirwa nk’Umwana yahawe kuganza inzu y’Imana. Kandi iyo nzu ni twebwe, niyo twagumya ugushira amanga n’ivyizigiro dufise muri Kristo.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twirinde ukutizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ni co gituma Mpwemu Yera avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Uwu musi nimwumva ijwi ryiwe,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />ntimukomantaze imitima yanyu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">nk’uko Abisirayeli babikoze igihe bangarariza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">bakangerageza mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Aho ba sogokuruza banyu bangerageza bakancaca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">naho bari barabonye ivyo nabakoreye imyaka mirongo ine.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Ni co gituma nabashavuriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ndavuga nti: ‘Imitima yabo yama izimira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">kandi ntibamenye inzira zanje.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ni co catumye ndahirana uburake nti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Ntibazokwigera binjira aho kuruhukira nateguye.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Zaburi 95:7-11</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Nuko rero bene Data, mwirinde kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe muri mwebwe agira umutima mubi utizera ngo bitume ava ku Mana nzima. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ahubwo, muhanurane imisi yose, tugishobora kuvuga “uwu musi”, kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe muri mwebwe akomantazwa no guhendwa n’icaha. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Kuko twahindutse abafatanije na Kristo, nimba vy’ukuri tuzigamye, gushitsa kw’iherezo, ivyizigiro bishikamye nk’ivyo twatanguranye. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Mwibuke ico Ivyanditswe bivuga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Uwu musi nimwumva ijwi ryayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ntimukomantaze imitima yanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">nk’uko Abisirayeli babikoze igihe bayigarariza.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Zaburi 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Mbega ni ba nde bagararije Imana, kandi bari barumvise ijwi ryayo? Si bamwe bari bavuye muri Egiputa barongowe na Mose? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Mbega ni ba nde bashavuje Imana imyaka mirongo ine? Si bamwe bacumura maze imivyimba yabo ikagwa mu bugaragwa? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Mbe ni ba nde Imana yabarira igihe yarahira ko batazokwigera binjira aho kuruhukira yateguye? Si bamwe batayumvira? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Ico tubona ni uko, kubera ukutizera kwabo, batashoboye kwinjira aho kuruhukira Imana yateguye.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Aho kuruhukira Imana yateguye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Ni co gituma, ko isezerano ryo kwinjira aho kuruhukira yateguye rikiriho, dukwiye kwirinda kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe muri mwebwe yohava atahashika. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Iyi nkuru nziza ivuga ko Imana yateguye aho kuruhukira twayumvise nk’uko na bo bayumvise. Ariko nta co yabamariye kuko batayakiranye ukwizera. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Ni twebwe abizeye gusa dushobora kwinjira aho kuruhukira Imana yateguye. Ariko ku bandi Imana yavuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Ni co catumye ndahirana uburake nti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Ntibazokwigera binjira aho kuruhukira nateguye.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Zaburi 95:11</ref></char></char></note>”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Ariko rero ibikorwa vyayo vyaheze igihe yarema isi. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Kuko hari ahantu yavuze ku vyerekeye umusi w’indwi iti: “Nuko ku musi ugira indwi Imana iraruhuka ibikorwa vyayo vyose.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Itanguriro 2:2</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ariko muri ico gice co hejuru Imana yavuze iti: “Ntibazokwigera binjira aho kuruhukira nateguye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Zaburi 95:11</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Aho kuruhukira Imana yateguye haracariho ngo abantu bahinjire, ariko ababwiwe ubu butumwa bwiza ubwa mbere ntibashoboye kuhinjira kuko bagararije Imana. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Ni co gituma Imana yashizeho ikindi gihe co kwinjira aho kuruhukira yateguye, kandi ico gihe ni “uwu musi”.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Zaburi 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char></char></note> Imana yongeye kubivuga haciye igihe kirekire iciye muri Dawidi, mu gice twamaze kuvugako, iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Nimwumva ijwi ry’Imana uwu musi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">ntimukomantaze imitima yanyu.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Kuko iyo Yosuwa aja kuba yarabashikanye aho kuruhukira Imana yari yarasezeranye, Imana ntiyari gusubira kuvuga ivyerekeye uwundi musi. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Haracariho rero akaruhuko gasa n’ak’umusi w’Isabato gategekanirijwe ubwoko bw’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Umuntu wese yinjiye aho kuruhukira Imana yateguye, araruhuka ibikorwa vyiwe nk’uko Imana na yo yaruhutse ibikorwa vyayo. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Muze natwe dukore ibishoboka vyose kugira ngo twinjire aho hantu ho kuruhukira Imana yateguye; ntihagire uwo muri twebwe agwa kubera ukutizera nk’uko vyabaye ku Bisirayeli.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Kuko ijambo ry’Imana ni rizima kandi ryuzuye ubushobozi. Rikarishe kurusha inkota y’ubugi bubiri; ririnjira rigashika aho ritandukanya umushaha n’impwemu, n’ingingo n’imisokoro. Rishira ahabona ivyipfuzo n’ivyiyumviro vy’umutima w’umuntu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Nta kintu na kimwe mu vyaremwe kinyegejwe imbere y’Imana. Imbere yayo vyose vyambaye ubusa kandi biragaragara. Kandi twese izotubaza ivyo twakoze vyose.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Umuherezi Mukuru akomeye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Ko dufise Umuherezi Mukuru akomeye, ari we Yesu Umwana w’Imana, yashitse mw’ijuru imbere y’Imana, muze tugumye cane ivyo twizeye. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Umuherezi mukuru dufise ashobora kubabarana natwe mu ntege nke zacu. Mbere yaciye mu mageragezwa twese ducamwo, ariko we nta caha yakoze. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Nuko muze twegere intebe y’Imana y’ubuntu dushize amanga, kugira ngo twakire imbabazi, turonke n’ubuntu vyo kudufasha mu gihe gikwiye.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Umuherezi mukuru wese atorwa mu bantu, agatorerwa guserukira abandi imbere y’Imana kugira ngo atange amashikanwa n’ibimazi vy’ivyaha. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Kuko na we ubwiwe ari umunyantegenke mu buryo bwinshi, arashobora gutahura abantu bagendera mu butamenya bagakora ibitari vyo. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Kandi ko na we ari umunyantegenke, ategerezwa gutanga ibimazi vy’ivyaha, atari ivy’abandi gusa, ariko n’ivyiwe na vyo. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Nta muntu n’umwe yiha ico cubahiro co kuba umuherezi mukuru; Imana ni yo imuhamagarira ico gikorwa, nk’uko yahamagaye Aroni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Na Kristo na we ntiyihaye ico cubahiro co kuba Umuherezi Mukuru. Yagihawe n’Imana aho yavuga iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Uri Umwana wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">uwu musi ndakuvyaye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Zaburi 2:7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Ahandi Imana yamubwiye iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Uri umuherezi w’ibihe bidashira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">mu buryo bwa Melekisedeki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Zaburi 110:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu akiri kw’isi, yarasenze kandi aringinga aboroga mbere anarira. Yasenga Imana yari ishoboye kumukiza urupfu. Imana yaramwumvise kuko yari aciye bugufi akayumvira mu bwizigirwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />N’aho yari Umwana w’Imana yize kwumvira biciye mu mubabaro yaciyemwo. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Amaze kuba uwutunganye rwose, yahindutse isoko ry’agakiza kadashira ku bamwumvira bose. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Kandi Imana yamugize Umuherezi Mukuru mu buryo bwa Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twirinde ntitugwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Dufise vyinshi twovuga kuri ivyo, ariko biragoye kubibasigurira, kuko bibagora gutahura. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Mwari mukwiye kuba muri abigisha, kuko haheze igihe kirekire mwizeye. Yamara muracakeneye kwigishwa ivya mbere vyo mu kuri kw’ijambo ry’Imana. Aho kurya ivyokurya vy’abakuze, muracakeneye amata. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Uwukinywa amata aba akiri umwana, nta co aba aramenya mu vyo kugororoka. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ariko ivyokurya bikomeye ni ivy’abakuze, kuko kubera ivyo baciyemwo bashitse aho batandukanya ikibi n’iciza.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Ni co gituma dukwiye guhindukirira inyigisho z’abakuze, tukava ku nyigisho za mbere z’ivy’ubutumwa bwa Kristo. Ntidukwiye gusubira gushiraho amatanguriro y’ivyo kwihana ibikorwa vy’impfagusa, ivyo kwizera Imana, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />inyigisho zijanye n’umubatizo, ukurambikwako ibiganza, ukuzuka kw’abapfuye n’urubanza rw’iherezo. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Dutere tuja imbere; kandi Imana ivyemeye, ni ko tuzobigenza.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Ntibishoboka kugarukana ku kwihana abigeze kwakirwa n’umuco, bakumviriza ku ngabire zo mw’ijuru, bakakira ku vya Mpwemu Yera, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />bakumviriza ku vyiza vy’ijambo ry’Imana no ku bushobozi bw’ibihe bigiye kuza, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />hanyuma bakava ku Mana. Ntibikunda kugarukana abantu nk’abo ku kwihana, kuko baba bahisemwo kubamba ubugira kabiri Umwana w’Imana, bagaha abandi akaryo ko kumutuka. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Iyo umurima wakiriye imvura iguye kuri wo hanyuma ugakuza ibiterwa bigirira ikimazi umurimyi, Imana irawuhezagira. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ariko umurima umera amahwa n’ibitovu nta co uba umaze, uba uri hafi kuvumwa, kandi amaherezo yawo ni uguturirwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Bakundwa, n’aho tuvuga aya majambo, turizera ko muri mu nzira nziza; inzira ibashikana ku gakiza. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Kuko Imana ntirenganya ngo yibagire ibikorwa mwakoze canke urukundo mwerekanye ku bw’izina ryayo mu gukorera abizera, kandi mukaba mukibandanya mubikora. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Ico twipfuza ni uko mubandanya mwerekana uwo mwete gushika kw’iherezo, kugira ngo ivyo mwiteze mudakekeranya bize bishike. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ivyo bizotuma mutaba abanebwe, ahubwo muzoba abigana abaragwa b’ivyasezeranywe, biciye mu kwizera no kuramiriza.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amasezerano y’Imana azana ivyizigiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Igihe Imana yaha isezerano Aburahamu, yarahiye mw’izina ryayo kuko ata rindi zina ry’uwundi muntu ayiruta yari kurahiramwo. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Yavuze iti: “Nzoguhezagira vy’ukuri kandi nzogwiza uruvyaro rwawe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Itanguriro 22:17</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Nuko Aburahamu arindira yihanganye, maze yakira ivyo Imana yari yaramusezeraniye.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Iyo abantu barahira, babikora mw’izina ry’umuntu abaruta, kandi iyo ndahiro iza ihagarika impari zose. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Imana na yo yakoresheje indahiro, kugira ngo abahawe isezerano bamenye badakekeranya ko idashobora guhindura ico yavuze. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Imana yatanze isezerano n’indahiro. Ibi bintu uko ari bibiri ntibishobora guhinduka kuko Imana idashobora kubesha. Ku bw’ivyo, twebwe abayihungiyeko, ivyo bidutera intege cane bigatuma twumira ku vyizigiro yadushize imbere. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Ivyo vyizigiro bimeze nk’inanga ifata ubwato mu kiyaga igumye kandi ikomeye ishigikiye imishaha yacu. Ni vyo bituma turengana ca gitambara gikinze ahera, tugashika imbere y’Imana; <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />aho Yesu yabanje kwinjira ku bwacu, amaze kuba Umuherezi Mukuru w’ibihe bidashira mu buryo bwa Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Umuherezi mukuru mu buryo bwa Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Uwo Melekisedeki yari umwami w’i Salemu, akaba n’umuherezi w’Imana Musumbavyose. Igihe Aburahamu yari atabarutse ahejeje kunesha ba bami, Melekisedeki yaje guhura na we aramuhezagira. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Aburahamu aca afata ica cumi c’ivyo yanyaze mu rugamba vyose agiha Melekisedeki. Izina Melekisedeki risigura “umwami w’ubugororotsi”; umwami w’i Salemu bisigura “umwami w’amahoro”. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Nta ho tubona ko yari afise se canke nyina, canke ba sekuruza. Nta ho tubona ko yavutse canke yapfuye. Asa n’Umwana w’Imana kuko yama ari umuherezi ibihe vyose.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Mwiyumvire ingene uwu Melekisedeki yari akomeye! Na Aburahamu, sekuruza w’Abisirayeli, yaravyemeje mu kumuha ica cumi c’ivyo yari yanyaze mu rugamba. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Ivyagezwe vya Mose vyategeka abaherezi bo mu muryango wa Lewi kwaka ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli ica cumi ku vyo bafise, abo na bo bari abavukanyi babo, kandi na bo bari uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Ariko Melekisedeki, atari uwo mu ruvyaro rwa Lewi, yarakiriye ica cumi ahawe na Aburahamu. Kandi Melekisedeki yarahezagiye Aburahamu, uwari yarakiriye isezerano ry’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Nta gukekeranya kuriho ko uwutanga umuhezagiro aba aruta uwuhabwa umuhezagiro. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Abaherezi bakira ica cumi ni abantu bapfa, ariko Melekisedeki we Ivyanditswe bivuga ko yamaho. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Dushobora kuvuga ko aba Balewi bakira ica cumi, bagihaye Melekisedeki biciye muri sekuruza Aburahamu igihe yakimuha. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Kuko naho Lewi atari bwavuke, yari akiri mu nda kwa Aburahamu igihe Melekisedeki yakira ica cumi ahawe na Aburahamu.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu agereranywa na Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Ivyagezwe vyashikiriye Abisirayeli biciye mu gikorwa c’ubuherezi bw’Abalewi. None iyo ubwo buherezi buba bwarashikije ugutungana Imana yashaka, hari icari gutuma ishiraho uwundi muherezi wo mu buryo bwa Melekisedeki, atari uwo mu buryo bwa Aroni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Kandi iyo ubuherezi buhindutse, n’ivyagezwe birahinduka. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Umuherezi turiko tuvuga ava mu wundi muryango, kandi nta muntu n’umwe ava muri uwo muryango yigeze akora ku gicaniro nk’umuherezi. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Birazwi ko Umwami wacu akomoka mu muryango wa Yuda, kandi Mose ntiyigeze avuga ko abaherezi bazokomoka muri uwo muryango. <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Ivyo birumvikana cane kuko habonetse uwundi muherezi ameze nka Melekisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Yesu ntiyabaye umuherezi habanje gukurikizwa ibisabwa bifatiye ku mamuko yiwe nk’umuntu, ahubwo yabaye umuherezi hakurikijwe ubushobozi bw’ubugingo budashobora kurandurwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Ivyanditswe Vyera bimuvugako ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">“Uri umuherezi w’ibihe bidashira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">mu buryo bwa Melekisedeki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Zaburi 110:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Ivyasabwa kera ku bijanye n’ubuherezi vyarakuweho kuko vyari bifise intege nke kandi nta co vyari bimaze <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />(kuko Ivyagezwe vya Mose nta gutungana vyashoboye gushitsa). Ariko ubu dufise ivyizigiro biruta ivyo, bituma twegera Imana.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Kandi ivyo vyabaye habanje kuba indahiro. Abaherezi ba mbere bo babayeho hatabanje kuba indahiro. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ariko Yesu yabaye umuherezi Imana ibanje kurahira iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Uhoraho yararahiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">kandi ntazohindura ico yavuze:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Uri umuherezi w’ibihe bidashira.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Zaburi 110:4</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ku bw’iyo ndahiro, Yesu yahindutse uwuhagarikiye isezerano riruta ayandi.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Mu gihe ca kera hari abaherezi benshi kuko urupfu rwababuza kubandanya igikorwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ariko Yesu we ni umuherezi ibihe vyose kuko ahoraho. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ni co gituma ashobora gukiza rwose abegera Imana bamwisunze, kuko abaho ibihe vyose abasengera ku Mana.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Uwo ni we Muherezi Mukuru twari dukwiye kuronka kuko ni uwera, ntagira agasembwa kandi ntiyandujwe n’icaha. Yatandukanijwe n’abanyavyaha, maze Imana imushira mu kibanza co mw’ijuru kirusha ibindi icubahiro. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Yesu aratandukanye n’abandi baherezi bakuru kuko we ntakeneye gutanga ibimazi ku musi ku musi, nk’uko abandi babanza gutanga ibimazi vy’ivyaha vyabo, hanyuma bakabona gutanga ivy’abandi bantu. Yesu we yabikoze rimwe rizima igihe yitanga nk’ikimazi ku bw’ivyaha vy’abantu. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ivyagezwe vyashiraho abaherezi bakuru bafise intege nke, ariko inyuma y’Ivyagezwe, Imana yatoranije Umwana wayo biciye mu ndahiro; uwo ni we yabaye Umuherezi Mukuru atunganye ibihe vyose.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Umuherezi mukuru w’isezerano rishasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Ico dushaka kuvuga ni iki: dufise Umuherezi Mukuru yicaye mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’intebe y’icubahiro y’Imana mw’ijuru. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Igikorwa ciwe yagikoreye ahera, Yakoreye igikorwa ciwe mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro, ikibanza nyakuri co gusengeramwo cubatswe n’Umwami Imana, atari amaboko y’abantu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Kubera umuherezi mukuru wese yashirirwaho gutanga amashikanwa n’ibimazi, n’Umuherezi Mukuru wacu na we yategerezwa kugira ico atanze. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Iyo Kristo aja kuba ari kw’isi, ntivyari gukunda ko aba umuherezi, kuko hari hasanzwe abaherezi batanga amashikanwa nk’uko Ivyagezwe vyabitegekanya. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Bakorera ibikorwa vyabo mu kibanza kigereranywa kikaba n’igitutu c’ivyo mw’ijuru. Kuko igihe Mose yagira yubake ihema, Imana yamubwiye imugabisha iti: “Uze urabe neza ko bikorwa nk’uko wavyerekewe kuri uwu musozi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kuvayo 25:40</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ariko Yesu, Umuherezi Mukuru wacu, yahawe igikorwa kiruta cane ic’abandi baherezi, kuko ni we muhuza wacu mw’isezerano riruta ayandi, ryubakiye ku masezerano aruta ayandi.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Iyo isezerano rya mbere rija kuba ritagira amahinyu, nta sezerano rya kabiri ryo kurisubirira ryari rikenewe. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ariko Imana yasanze hari ico igaya abantu bayo, maze ivuga iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Igihe kiraje,” ni ko Uhoraho avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">“aho nzogirana isezerano rishasha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">n’inzu ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">hamwe n’inzu ya Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ntirizoba risa na rya sezerano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">nagirana na ba sekuruza babo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">aho nabafata ukuboko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">nkabarongora ndabakura mu gihugu ca Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">kuko ntibagumanye ubwizigirwa mw’isezerano ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">nuko nanje nca ndabakurako umutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ni ko Uhoraho avuze.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Iri ni ryo sezerano nzogirana n’inzu ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">inyuma y’aho, ni ko Uhoraho avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Nzoshira ivyagezwe vyanje mu bwenge bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ndavyandike mu mitima yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Nzoba Imana yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">na bo babe abantu banje.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Ntibazosubira kwigisha ababanyi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">canke ngo babwirane hagati yabo bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Menya Uhoraho,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">kuko bose bazomenya jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kuva kuri muto muri bo kugeza ku mukuru.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Kuko nzobaharira ibibi vyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">kandi sinzosubira kwibuka ivyaha vyabo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yeremiya 31:31-34</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Imana ivuze ko iri sezerano ari “rishasha”, bisigura ko yatse agaciro irya mbere; kandi ikimaze gutakaza agaciro kiba kigira kizimangane.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Gusengera mw’ihema ryo kw’isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Isezerano rya mbere ryari rifise ibisabwa bijanye no gusenga hamwe n’ikibanza co gusengeramwo hano kw’isi. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Hari ibibanza bibiri mw’ihema. Mu kibanza ca mbere harimwo igiterekwako amatara, imeza hamwe n’imikate yashikaniwe Imana. Ico kibanza citwa Ahera. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Hanyuma haca haza igitambara gikinze, inyuma yaco ni ho hari ihema ryitwa Ahera Cane, <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Ico kibanza carimwo igicaniro gikozwe mu nzahabu baturirirako ibimota neza hamwe n’Isandugu y’Isezerano, yari yometseko inzahabu impande zose. Muri iyo Sandugu harimwo ibakure ry’inzahabu ririmwo manu, ya nkoni ya Aroni yatutuzako amababi hamwe na vya bisate vy’amabuye vyari vyanditseko amajambo y’isezerano. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Hejuru y’iyo Sandugu hari abakerubi b’ubwiza, amababa yabo yari ashanje hejuru y’Isandugu y’Isezerano, ari co kibanza ivyaha vyaharirirwamwo. Ariko ibi ntidushobora kubivuga ido n’ido muri aka kanya.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ivyo bintu vyose bimaze gutegurwa, abaherezi baraheza bakinjira igihe cose muri ca kibanza ca mbere c’ihema, bagaheza bagakora ivyo idini ryabo ryabasaba gukora. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ariko umuherezi mukuru wenyene ni we yari yemerewe kwinjira mu kibanza ca kabiri c’ihema, na ho nyene rimwe mu mwaka. Muri ico kibanza yahinjirana amaraso agiye gutanga imbere y’Imana ku bw’ivyaha vyiwe no ku bw’ivyaha abantu bakoze mu butamenya. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Muri ibi vyose, Mpwemu Yera yariko yerekana ko inzira yinjira Ahera Cane itari bwuguruke, igihe cose iryo hema ryo gusengeramwo rya mbere ryari rikihari. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Iki ni ikigereranyo cerekana igihe c’ubu. Kuko amashikanwa n’ibimazi abaherezi bashikanira Imana, ntivyashobora gutunganya imitima y’abaje kuyisenga. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Vyari ivyokurya no kunywa gusa n’imigenzo itandukanye yo kwiyuhagira. Yari amategeko yo ku mubiri gusa kugeza igihe ibintu vyari bigiye guhinduka.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaraso ya Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ariko Kristo yaje nk’Umuherezi Mukuru w’ivyiza bisanzwe bihari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zimwe mu nzandiko za kera zivuga ngo: ivyiza bigiye kuza.</char></note>, yinjira mw’ihema rikuru kandi ritunganye kuruta ayandi. Iryo ntiryubatswe n’amaboko y’abantu, bisigura ko ritari iryo mu vyaremwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Kristo yinjiye Ahera Cane rimwe rizima, atitwaje amaraso y’impene canke ay’impfizi z’inka yo gutanga nk’ikimazi, ahubwo yinjiranye amaraso yiwe bwite. Uko ni ko yaturonkeye ugucungurwa kw’ibihe vyose. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Nimba amaraso y’impene n’ay’impfizi z’inka n’umunyota w’inka y’ishashi ituriwe bimijagiwe ku bantu banduye vyarashobora gutuma bahumanuka ku mibiri yabo, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />namwe mwibaze ingene amaraso ya Kristo, we yitanze nk’ikimazi gitunganye c’ivyaha vyacu, akiha Imana biciye kuri Mpwemu Yera ahoraho, azorushiriza kweza imitima yacu akayikuramwo ibikorwa bipfuye kugira ngo dushobore gukorera Imana nzima.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ni co gituma Kristo ari umuhuza w’isezerano rishasha hagati y’Imana n’abantu, kugira ngo abahamagawe bose baronke imihezagiro idashira Imana yabasezeraniye. Kuko Kristo yapfuye kugira ngo abakize igihano c’ivyaha bakoze bakiri mw’isezerano rya mbere.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Iyo hari ikete ryo kuraga, biba nkenerwa kwerekana ko uwanditse iryo kete yamaze gupfa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Ivyanditse muri iryo kete ryo kuraga bishirwa mu ngiro iyo uwavyanditse yamaze gupfa. Akiriho, ivyanditswe muri ryo ntibishobora gushirwa mu ngiro. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ni co gituma n’isezerano rya mbere na ryo ryagiye mu ngiro habanje guseseka amaraso. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Kuko Mose amaze gusomera abantu bose amabwirizwa y’Imana, yakiriye amaraso y’impfizi n’ay’impene hamwe n’amazi, ayamijagira kuri ca gitabu c’ivyagezwe vy’Imana no ku bantu bose, akoresheje amashami y’agati kitwa ezobu n’ubwoya bw’intama bwera cane. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Maze aravuga ati: “Aya ni amaraso y’isezerano Imana ibategeka kwitondera.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kuvayo 24:8</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Hanyuma abigenza uko nyene, amijagira ya maraso kw’ihema n’ibikoresho vyose bakoresha mu gukorera Imana. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Mu bisanzwe, ivyagezwe vya Mose vyasaba ko ibintu nka vyose vyozwa n’amaraso. Kuko ata guharirwa ivyaha gushobora kubaho, ata maraso asesetse.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Vyari bikwiye ko ihema n’ibiri muri ryo, na vyo akaba ari ishusho ry’ivyo mw’ijuru, vyezwa n’amaraso y’ibikoko. Ariko ivyo mw’ijuru vyari bikwiye kwezwa n’ibimazi biruta amaraso y’ibikoko. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kuko Kristo atinjiye Ahera Cane hubatswe n’amaboko y’abantu, na kare ihema ryubatswe n’abantu ryari ikigereranyo c’ihema nyakuri riri mw’ijuru. Ahubwo yinjiye mw’ijuru ubwaryo kugira ngo aduserukire imbere y’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Kandi ntiyinjiye kugira ngo yitange kenshi, nk’uko umuherezi mukuru wa hano kw’isi yinjira Ahera Cane uko umwaka utashe yitwaje amaraso atari ayiwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Iyo bija kuba uko, Kristo yategerezwa gupfa incuro nyinshi, kuva isi ikiremwa. Ariko noneho yaserutse rimwe rizima, mu gihe c’iherezo, kugira ngo akureho icaha akoresheje ikimazi c’urupfu rwiwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Kandi nk’uko umuntu wese ategerezwa gupfa rimwe maze inyuma yaho hakaza urubanza, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />ni ko na Kristo na we yatanzwe nk’ikimazi rimwe gusa kugira ngo akureho ivyaha vya benshi. Azogaruka irya kabiri atazanywe n’ivyaha, ariko aje gukiza abamwiteze bose.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo yitanze rimwe gusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Ivyagezwe vya Mose ni ikigereranyo c’ivyiza bigiye kuza; si ukuri kw’ivyo vyiza. Mu gihe c’Ivyagezwe, baguma batanga ibimazi uko umwaka utashe, yamara ivyo bimazi ntivyigeze bishobora gutunganya rwose abegera Imana bayisenga. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Iyo biba vyarashoboye gutunganya rwose abegera Imana bayisenga, vyari kuba vyarahagaritswe gutangwa kuko batari kuba bacumva ijwi ribagiriza icaha. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ahubwo ivyo bimazi vyama bibibutsa ivyaha vyabo uko umwaka utashe. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Amaraso y’impfizi z’inka n’impene ntashobora gukuraho ivyaha.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ni co gituma igihe Kristo yaza mw’isi yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Ibimazi n’amashikanwa si vyo washatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">ariko wanteguriye umubiri;<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />amashikanwa aturiwe n’amashikanwa y’ivyaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">ntivyaguhimbaye.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Nanje ndavuga nti: ‘Ndi hano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">nje gukora ivyo ugomba, Mana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">nk’uko umuzingo w’igitabu umvugako.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Zaburi 40:6-8</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Ubwa mbere Kristo yavuze ati: “Ntiwashatse kandi ntiwashimye ibimazi n’amashikanwa canke ibimazi bituririwe ku gicaniro n’ibimazi vy’ivyaha, kandi vyategekanywa n’ivyagezwe vya Mose.” <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Ni ho yavuga ati: “Ehe, nje gukora ivyo ugomba.” Vyumvikana ko yakuyeho isezerano rya mbere, akarisubiriza irya kabiri. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kuko ico Imana yashaka kwari uko twezwa biciye mu kimazi c’umubiri wa Yesu Kristo, rimwe rizima.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Mu gihe c’isezerano rya mbere, umuherezi wese yakora igikorwa ciwe ku gicaniro imisi yose agatanga kenshi ibimazi amenyereye gutanga, yamara ntivyashobora gukuraho ivyaha. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ariko Umuherezi Mukuru wacu yitanze rimwe rizima, nk’ikimazi kimwe gusa gikuraho ivyaha, hanyuma yicara mu kibanza c’icubahiro i buryo bw’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Aho ni ho arindiririye ko Imana icisha bugufi abansi biwe ikabashira musi y’ibirenge vyiwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Biciye kuri ico kimazi kimwe, yashikanye ku gutungana, rwose kandi ibihe vyose, abejejwe ivyaha vyabo.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Kandi na Mpwemu Yera na we arabitwemeza. Kuko avuga ngo:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Iri ni ryo sezerano nzogirana n’abantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">inyuma y’aho, ni ko Uhoraho avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Nzoshira ivyagezwe vyanje mu mitima yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">ndavyandike mu bwenge bwabo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Yeremiya 31:33</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Yongerako ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“Sinzosubira kwibuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">ivyaha n’ibikorwa bibi vyabo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Yeremiya 31:34</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Kandi iyo ivyaha bimaze guharirwa, ntihaba hagikenewe ibimazi vyo kubikuraho.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwihangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ni co gituma, bene Data, dushobora kwinjira ata bwoba Ahera Cane ho mw’ijuru ku bw’amaraso ya Yesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Yatwugururiye inzira nshasha itanga ubugingo biciye muri ca gitambara gikinze Ahera Cane, ari wo mubiri wiwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Kandi ko dufise Umuherezi Mukuru aganza inzu y’Imana, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />muze twegere aho Imana iri dufise imitima irimwo ukuri kandi tuyizeye ata gukekeranya, imitima yacu yogejwe igakurwamwo ibiyagiriza, n’imibiri yacu yogeshejwe amazi meza. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Muze twumire ku vyizigiro twatura tutanyiganyiga, kuko Imana yasezeranye ni iyo kwizigirwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Kandi turondere ingene twoterana intege zo gukundana no gukora ibikorwa vyiza. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Kandi ntiduhebe gukoranira hamwe, nk’uko bamwe babigira, ahubwo duterane intege, na canecane ubu mubona ko umusi wo kugaruka kwiwe wegereje.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Kuko nitwabandanya dukora ivyaha ibigirankana kandi tumaze kumenya ukuri, nta kimazi co gukura ivyaha kizoba kigisigaye. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Hazoba hasigaye gusa kwitegana ubwoba urubanza rw’Imana n’umuriro uteye ubwoba uzoturira abansi bayo. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Abatumviye ivyagezwe vya Mose bose baricwa ata kigongwe, bagirijwe n’ivyabona bibiri canke bitatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Namwe mwibaze ingene igihano kizohabwa abagaye Umwana w’Imana, bagatitura amaraso y’isezerano yabogeje ivyaha, kandi bagatuka Mpwemu w’ubuntu, kizoba gikomeye. <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Kuko turazi uwavuze ngo: “Uguhora ni ukwanje; ni jewe nzokwishura umuntu ibikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Gusubiramwo 32:35</ref></char></char></note> Yongerako avuga ati: “Uhoraho azocira urubanza abantu biwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:36">Gusubiramwo 32:36</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:14">Zaburi 135:14</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ni ikintu giteye ubwoba gukorokera mu maboko y’Imana nzima.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Mwibuke uko vyari vyifashe mu misi ya mbere, mumaze kwakirwa n’umuco w’Imana. Mwaciye mu mibabaro myinshi, ariko mugumana ubwizigirwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Rimwe na rimwe mwamaramarizwa ku mugaragaro mugakubitwa, ahandi naho mugafasha abariko baragirirwa ivyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Mwagirira impuhwe abapfunzwe, kandi iyo babanyaze ivyanyu mwavyemerana umunezero, kuko mwari muzi ko mufise ubutunzi burengeye ubwo kandi buzokwamaho. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Ntimugatakaze ivyizigiro mufise mu Mwami, kuko bifise impera ikomeye.<verse eid="HEB 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mukwiye kwihangana kugira ngo nimwamara gukora ivyo Imana ishaka muze muhabwe ivyasezeranywe. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Kuko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Hasigaye igihe gito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">uwugira aze azoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">kandi ntazoteba.”<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Kandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">“Umugororotsi wanje azobeshwaho n’ukwizera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Ariko niyasubira inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">ntazohimbara umutima wanje.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:3">Habakuki 2:3</ref>,<ref loc="HAB 2:4">4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Ariko twebwe ntituri mu basubira inyuma bagahona, ahubwo turi mu bizera bagakiza imitima yabo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Ukwizera ni ukudakekeranya ko ivyo wizigiye bizoba; ni ukutagira amazinda ku vyo utabonesha amaso. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye abantu ba kera bashingirwa intahe.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Ukwizera ni kwo gutuma dutahura ko isi yose yaremwe n’Ijambo ry’Imana, ko ivyo tubona vyavuye mu bitaboneka.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Abeli yashikaniye Imana ikimazi cemewe na yo kurusha ica Kayini. Ukwo kwizera kwiwe kwatumye yemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi, kuko Imana ubwayo yemeye ishikanwa ryiwe. Kandi ku bw’ukwizera kwiwe, naho yapfuye, aracavuga.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="GEN 5:24">Itanguriro 5:24</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note>Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Enoki ajanwa mw’ijuru atabanje gupfa. Yarazimanganye abantu baramubura, kuko Imana yamujanye. Imbere yo kujanwa, yari azwi nk’umuntu ahimbara Imana. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kandi ata kwizera, ntibishoboka ko umuntu ahimbara Imana. Umuntu wese ashaka kwegera Imana, ategerezwa kwizera ko iriho kandi ko iha impera abayirondera.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Nowa yubaka ubwato bunini kugira ngo akize umuryango wiwe umwuzure. Yumviye Imana yamugabishije ku bintu bitari bwigere biba. Uko ni ko yaciriye isi urubanza, kandi kubera ukwizera kwiwe, Imana na yo yaremeje ko yari umugororotsi.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Aburahamu yumvira Imana igihe yamuhamagara ngo aje mu gihugu yari igiye kumuha ngo kibe iragi ryiwe. Yavuye mu gihugu ciwe atazi iyo agiye. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Ashitse muri ico gihugu Imana yamusezeraniye, yahabaye mu kwizera, kuko yari nk’umunyamahanga. Yaba mu mahema, kandi na Isaka na Yakobo, abaragwa b’iryo sezerano, na bo vyabagendeye uko. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Aburahamu yari arindiye igisagara gifise amatanguriro yateguwe kandi yubatswe n’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Sara ashobora gusama inda, naho yari ingumba kandi abakaba yari ashaje cane. Yizeye ko Imana yasezeranye ari umwizigirwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ni co gituma mu muntu umwe, uwasa n’uwapfuye, havuyemwo uruvyaro rwinshi nk’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru, rudaharurika nk’umusenyi wo ku nkengera z’ikiyaga.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Aba bantu bose bapfuye bacizeye ivyo Imana yasezeranye. Ntibaronse ivyo basezeraniwe, ariko barabibona biri kure bakabinezerererwa; bakemera ko ari abanyamahanga n’ingenzi kw’isi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Abantu bavuga nk’uku baba berekana neza ko barondera igihugu cabo bwite. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Iyo bipfuza igihugu baje bavamwo, bari gushobora kwisubirirayo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ariko bariko barondera igihugu kiruta ibindi, igihugu co mw’ijuru. Ni co gituma Imana idaterwa n’isoni no kwitwa Imana yabo, kuko yabateguriye igisagara.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Aburahamu atanga Isaka nk’ikimazi igihe Imana yariko iramugeza. Aburahamu, uwari yarakiriye amasezerano y’Imana, yari yiteguriye gutanga Isaka, umwana wiwe w’ikinege nk’ikimazi, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />naho Imana yari yaramwibwiriye iti: “Uruvyaro rwawe uzoruronka biciye muri Isaka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Itanguriro 21:12</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Aburahamu yiyumviriye ko Imana ishobora kuzura Isaka, kandi ubiravye asa n’aho yamusubijwe avuye mu bapfuye.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Isaka ahezagira Yakobo na Esawu ku bijanye na kazoza.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Yakobo, igihe yari ashaje cane kandi agira apfe, ahezagira abahungu ba Yosefu, maze akunama agasenga Imana yishimikije inkoni yitwaza.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Yosefu, igihe yagira apfe, avuga ko Abisirayeli bazova muri Egiputa, maze akababwira uko bazoba bakwiye kugenza amagufa yiwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye abavyeyi ba Mose bamunyegeza amezi atatu amaze kuvuka, kuko babonye ko ari umwana adasanzwe, ntibatinya kurenga itegeko ry’umwami.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Mose, amaze gukura, yanka kwitwa umuhungu w’umukobwa wa Farawo. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Yahisemwo kubabazanywa n’ubwoko bw’Imana abirutisha kunezerererwa ibihimbaro vy’icaha vy’akanya gato. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Yiyumvira ko ari ivy’igiciro kubabazwa ku bwa Kristo kurusha kugira ubutunzi bwo muri Egiputa, kuko yari ahanze amaso impera yiwe muri kazoza. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye ava muri Egiputa, ntiyatinya ishavu ry’umwami. Yarashikamye arabandanya, nk’uwubona ivyo abandi batabona. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye ategeka Abisirayeli kwubahiriza Pasika, amijagira amaraso ku bishimaryango kugira ngo wa mumarayika w’umuranduzi ntiyice abahungu b’imfura babo.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Abisirayeli baca mu Kiyaga Gitukura nk’abagendera kw’isi yumye. Ariko Abanyegiputa bagerageje kubakurikira, bose bakarengerwa n’amazi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Abisirayeli bazunguruka Yeriko imisi indwi, maze inzitiro z’ico gisagara zirasenyuka.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye Rahabu, maraya, aticanwa n’abagararije Imana, kuko yakiranye umutima mwiza abatasi b’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Mbega nongereko iki? Vyofata umwanya muremure mvuze inkuru za Gidiyoni, Baraki, Samusoni, Yefuta, Dawidi, Samweli, n’abavugishwa n’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Ukwizera ni kwo kwatumye abo bantu bigarurira ubwami bwinshi, bagategeka mu butungane, kandi bakaronka ivyo Imana yari yarasezeranye. Bugaye iminwa y’intambwe, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />bazimya imbeya z’umuriro, kandi bakira kwicishwa inkota. Intege nke zabo zahindutse inkomezi; babaye abahizi ku rugamba bashwiragiza ingabo z’abanyamahanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Hari abagore bazuriwe ababo. Ariko hari n’abishwe bakubaguwe kuko banse kwihakana Imana ngo barekurwe. Bashaka kuzukira ubuzima burusha ubu kuba bwiza. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Abandi barashinyaguriwe barakubitwa. Abandi baboshwe iminyororo batabwa mu mabohero. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Hari abishwe batewe amabuye, abandi bahimburwamwo kubiri n’imisumeno, abandi bicishwa inkota. Hari abayerera bambaye insato z’intama n’iz’impene, ata co bafise, bahahazwa kandi bafatwa nabi. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Ntibari bakwiye kuba kuri iyi si! Bayerera mu bugaragwa no mu misozi, binyegeza mu masenga no mu binogo.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Abo bantu bose bashingiwe intahe ku bw’ukwizera kwabo, ariko nta n’umwe muri bo yaronse ivyo Imana yasezeranye vyose. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Kuko Imana yari idufitiye iciyumviro kiruta ibindi kuba ciza. Intumbero yayo n’uko badashikira ugutunganywa rwose batari kumwe natwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Ni co gituma, ko dukikijwe n’isinzi ry’ivyabona bingana gutyo, dukwiye twiyambura ibituboha vyose bikatubuza kubandanya, hamwe n’icaha kitwizingirako vyoroshe, maze twiruke n’umwete mu rugendo Imana yashize imbere yacu. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Duhange amaso Yesu Kristo, we yatanguje ukwizera kwacu akaba ari na we agushitsa ku gutungana. Umunezero yashizwe imbere ni wo watumye yihanganira umusaraba n’isoni zawo. Ubu yicaye mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’intebe y’inganji y’Imana. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Mwiyumvire ingene yagwanijwe n’abanyavyaha, kugira ngo ntimucike intege mu mitima yanyu.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana itoza indero abana bayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Ntimuragwanya icaha gushika aho amaraso yanyu aseseka. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Muramaze kwibagira ya majambo yo kubatera intege Imana yababwira nk’abana bayo? Yavuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwana wanje, ntukagaye uguhana kw’Uhoraho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">kandi ntugacike intege iyo aguhanye;<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />kuko Uhoraho aha indero abo akunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">kandi ahana abo yemera ko ari abana biwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">Imigani 3:11</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Mwihanganire uku guhabwa indero n’Imana, muzi ko ivyo ibikorera abana bayo bwite. Mwoba mumaze kubona umwana se adahana? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Nimba Imana itabahana, nk’uko ibikorera abana bayo bose, ivyo bisigura ko muri ibivyarwa, mutari abana bayo vy’ukuri. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Nimba ba data bo kw’isi baraduhana tukabubaha, dukwiye kurushiriza kugamburukira Data w’impwemu, kugira ngo tubeho. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Ba data baduhanye igihe gito, nk’uko biyumvira ko bikenewe. Ariko Imana ibikora ku neza yacu, kugira ngo dusangire na yo ukwera. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Mu gihe co guhanwa, nta muntu n’umwe anezerezwa n’igihano, kuko kirababaza. Ariko mu nyuma, abaciye muri ukwo guhabwa indero bimbura ivyamwa vy’amahoro no kugororoka.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Nuko rero, nimugorore amaboko yanyu arushe, mukomeze n’amavi acitse intege. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Mugorore inzira ibirenge vyanyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Imigani 4:26</ref></char></char></note> bicamwo kugira ngo n’abacumbagira ntibatembe, ahubwo bakire.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugabisha no gutera intege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Murondere kubana amahoro n’abantu bose no kubaho ubuzima bwejejwe, kuko abatejejwe ntibazobona Imana. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mwitaneho kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe muri mwebwe ananirwa ntashikire ubuntu bw’Imana. Mwirinde ntihakagire ikintu na kimwe kibi kimeze nk’umuzi utera umurarazi kiba hagati yanyu kigatera uruhagarara, benshi bononekara. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Ntihakagire n’umwe muri mwebwe aba umushakanyi canke atubaha Imana nka Esawu yagurishije kuba samuragwa kwiwe, akagukaba isahani imwe y’ivyokurya. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Murazi ko mu nyuma yarondeye guhabwa umuhezagiro na se, ariko ntiyemererwa. Naho yawuronderanye amarira menshi, ntivyakunda ko ahindura ivyo yari yarakoze.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Mwebwe ntimwegereye umusozi umuntu ashobora gukorako: nta mbeya z’umuriro, nta mwijima, nta joro, nta mituragaro, nk’uko vyabaye ku Bisirayeli ku musozi Sinayi. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Bo bumvise ugusamirana kw’inzamba n’ijwi riteye ubwoba ku buryo abaryumvise basavye Imana kudasubira kuvugana na bo. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Baciye bagenza umugongo bumvise ijwi ry’Imana rivuga riti: “Ikintu cose kizokwegera uwu musozi, naho coba igitungwa, kize cicishwe amabuye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Kuvayo 19:12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ivyo babonye vyari biteye ubwoba ku buryo Mose ubwiwe yavuze ati: “Ndiko ndajugumira kubera ubwoba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Gusubiramwo 9:19</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ariko mwebwe mwegereye Umusozi Siyoni, igisagara c’Imana nzima, Yerusalemu co mw’ijuru, aho abamarayika ibihumbi n’ibihumbi bama bakoraniye mu munezero. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Mwegereye ikoraniro ry’abana b’imfura b’Imana banditswe mw’ijuru. Mwegereye Imana ubwayo, umucamanza w’abantu bose. Mwegereye impwemu z’abagororotsi bari mw’ijuru, bamaze gutunganywa rwose. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Mwegereye Yesu, umuhuza w’isezerano rishasha riri hagati y’Imana n’abantu, kandi mwegereye amaraso aduhumanura, avuga ivyiza kurusha aya Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Mwirinde ntimwanke kwumviriza iyiriko aravuga. Kuko nimba Abisirayeli batashoboye gukira igihano igihe banka kwumviriza Mose ariko arabagabisha ari kw’isi, none tweho twokira gute igihano twanse kwumviriza iyivuga iri mw’ijuru. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Igihe Imana yavugira ku musozi Sinayi, ijwi ryayo ryanyiganyije isi; uno musi na ho Imana isezerana iti: “Nzosubira kunyiganyiza, atari isi gusa, ariko n’ijuru na ryo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hagayi 2:6</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Ibi bisigura ko ibishobora kunyiganyizwa vyose bizokurwaho, kugira ngo ibidashobora kunyiganyizwa bigumeho.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ko twakira Ubwami budashobora kunyiganyizwa, muze dushimire Imana kandi tuyisenge mu buryo buyihimbara tuyitinya kandi tuyubashe. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Kuko “Imana yacu ni umuriro utongora.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Gusubiramwo 4:24</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amajambo yo guherezako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Tubandanye gukundana nk’abavukana. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Ntimwibagire kwakirana urukundo ingenzi, kuko bamwe mu babikoze bakiriye abamarayika batabizi. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Mwibuke abari mu mabohero, nk’aho mwoba muri kumwe na bo mw’ibohero. Mwibuke abababazwa nk’aho namwe mwumva ububabare bwabo mu mibiri yanyu.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Ukwubakana kwubahirizwe na bose, kandi ntihakagire icanduza uburiri bw’abubakanye; kuko Imana izocira urubanza abagendera mu bushakanyi no mu busambanyi. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Ntimugakunde amahera mu kubaho kwanyu, ahubwo mubumbwe n’ivyo mufise. Kuko Imana yavuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">“Sinzokwigera ndaguta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">sinzokwigera ndaguheba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Gusubiramwo 31:6</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ni co gituma tuvuga ata bwoba tuti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Uhoraho ni we mutabazi wanje; sinzotinya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">None abantu buntu bongira iki?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Zaburi 118:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:7">7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mwibuke abarongozi banyu babigishije ijambo ry’Imana. Murabe ivyiza vyavuye mu buzima bwabo hanyuma mwigane ukwizera kwabo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kristo ntahinduka: uko yari ari ejo ni ko ari uno musi n’ibihe bidashira.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Ntimukemere kuzimizwa n’inyigisho z’ivyaduka z’uburyo bwose. Inkomezi z’imitima yanyu ziva mu buntu bw’Imana, ntiziva mu gukurikiza migenzo ijanye n’ivyokurya, kuko idashobora gufasha abayikurikiza. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Turafise igicaniro abaherezi bakora mw’ihema badafise uburenganzira bwo kurirako.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mu gihe c’Isezerano rya Kera, umuherezi mukuru yazana amaraso y’ibitungwa Ahera Cane nk’ikimazi c’ivyaha, ariko imibiri y’ivyo bitungwa yaturirirwa inyuma y’aho bari bashinze amahema. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ni co gituma na Yesu yapfiriye inyuma y’igisagara kugira ngo ashikane abantu biwe ku kwera akoresheje amaraso yiwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nuko rero muze tuje iyo ari inyuma y’aho dushinze amahema, twemere gukengerwa nka we. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Kuko hano kw’isi tutahafise igisagara camaho, ahubwo turiko turondera igisagara kizoza.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Nuko rero muze twame duha Imana ikimazi c’ishimwe duciye muri Yesu, ni co camwa c’iminwa yacu yatura izina ryiwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Kandi ntimwibagire gukora ivyiza no gufashanya, kuko ivyo ni ibimazi bihimbara Imana.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Mugamburukire abarongozi banyu kandi mukore ivyo babategeka, kuko barinda imitima yanyu, kandi bazobibazwa n’Imana. Muborohereze kugira ngo babikorane umunezero, batababaye, kuko ivyo nta ciza vyobazanira.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mudusengere. Imitima yacu nta kibi itwagiriza kandi dushaka gukora vyose mu buryo bwiza. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ariko canecane ndabinginze munsengere kugira ngo Imana ize inshoboze kugaruka iwanyu.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amajambo yo kurangiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Imana y’amahoro, yazuye Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo mu bapfuye, we mwungere mukuru w’intama yashizeho isezerano ridashira biciye mu maraso yiwe, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />abe ari yo ibaha ivyiza mukeneye vyose kugira ngo mukore ivyo ishaka. Ishitse muri twebwe, biciye mu bushobozi bwa Yesu Kristo, ibiyihimbara vyose. Icubahiro cose kibe icayo ibihe vyose. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ndabinginga bene Data, mushire umutima kuri aya majambo yo kubatera intege, kuko iri kete nanditse si rirerire.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Ndashaka ko mumenya ko mwene Data Timoteyo yarekuwe atakiri mw’ibohero. Niyashika aho ndi vuba, tuzozanana kubaramutsa.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mundamukirize abarongozi banyu bose n’abizera bose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 13:24">Abizera bo mu Butaliyano barabaramutsa.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Ubuntu bw’Imana bubane namwe mwese.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>